  "question": {
    "text": "A merry-go-round is at rest, pivoted on a frictionless axis. A child of mass&nbsp;<math><mi>m</mi> </math> runs along the path tangential to the rim with speed&nbsp;<math><mi>v</mi> </math> and jumps on to merry-go-round. If <math> <mi>R</mi> </math>is the radius of the merry-go-round and <math> <mi>I</mi> </math> is the moment of inertia, then the angular velocity of the merry-go-round and the child is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow> <mrow> <mi>m</mi><msup> <mi>R</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow> </mfrac> </mrow> </math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow>  <mfrac>   <mrow>    <mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow>   <mi>I</mi>  </mfrac>  </mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow>  <mfrac>   <mrow>    <mi>m</mi><msup>     <mi>R</mi>     <mn>2</mn>    </msup>    <mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi></mrow>   <mrow>    <mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow>  </mfrac>  </mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math> <mrow>  <mfrac>   <mi>I</mi>   <mrow>    <mi>m</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>R</mi></mrow>  </mfrac>  </mrow></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "By law of conservation of angular momentum<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mspace mathvariant=\"italic\" width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace mathvariant=\"italic\" width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace mathvariant=\"italic\" width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace mathvariant=\"italic\" width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace mathvariant=\"italic\" width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace mathvariant=\"italic\" width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace mathvariant=\"italic\" width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace mathvariant=\"italic\" width=\"0.5em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">mvR</mtext><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mfenced><msub><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">I</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">system</mtext></msub></mfenced><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">&#969;</mtext></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mspace width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace mathvariant=\"italic\" width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace mathvariant=\"italic\" width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace mathvariant=\"italic\" width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace mathvariant=\"italic\" width=\"0.5em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">mvR</mtext><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">I</mtext><mo>+</mo><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">mR</mtext><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">&#969;</mtext></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mspace mathvariant=\"italic\" width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace mathvariant=\"italic\" width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace mathvariant=\"italic\" width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace mathvariant=\"italic\" width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace mathvariant=\"italic\" width=\"0.5em\"/><mspace mathvariant=\"italic\" width=\"0.5em\"/><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">&#969;</mtext><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">mvR</mtext><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">I</mtext><mo>+</mo><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">mR</mtext><mn mathvariant=\"italic\">2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math>"
  }
